* Contains all required changes to make Calendso run from a subfolder on a webserver of choice. Advanced hosting options HOWTO to be written, but to enable, simply set `BASE_PATH=/yourfolder` and don't forget to set `NEXTAUTH_URL`.

Combine with Nginx using the following config as inspiration:
```
location /calendso {
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host $host;
    proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;
    rewrite /calendso/(.*) /calendso/$1 break; 
}
```

**Note: router.basePath === "" if it is not applicable.**

